{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tdDUbRy4RHQ9_9liFm316A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:04.681849+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tdDUbRy4RHQ9_9liFm316A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/M2oNibC3l5n0KEiaAQloRPGDV3dyPLxHbG6t45iaFicjibconMj18Vkrrtur2PDxxwNefJRToswMRNibzV5r0RJCYYe05vt70EiaopUPfJaFZwb6ow/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/AtlH5ZAD5U5JTm6UplWg7xYdIhkXvx1BYKviaUJiaHIlSt3gjQcxEUdnlqFZz5zzBUicVGf6q4CPtoLcL1g2iaibnwJUljkJ0RytmH3oMyO86M3s/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为增进全国高校优秀本科生对核物理基础与应用研究的了解，吸引有志于投身核科学与技术事业的青年学子走近科研现场，亲身感受“大国重器”的真实脉搏，中国原子能科学研究院核物理研究所2026年本科生暑期夏令营现在开始报名。本次夏令营将围绕核物理前沿、核数据、加速器技术、核物理应用、中子科学、激光技术等方向，组织专题学术报告、实验平台参观、导师面对面交流和研究生招生政策介绍等活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>我们诚挚欢迎全国高校优秀本科生报名参加，在科研一线了解真实的核物理研究，在交流中寻找适合自己的研究方向，在国家战略科技力量中开启新的成长旅程。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>一</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>关于我们</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>原子能院核物理研究所（以下简称物理所）是我国核物理研究的重要基地之一，也是中核集团唯一的核物理研究基地。物理所下设9个研究室，并负责4个国家级重点实验室或研究中心的运行管理，依托加速器、反应堆、激光器等大科学装置开展核物理基础、核物理应用、核数据、加速器技术、中子科学、激光技术等领域研究。</span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/M2oNibC3l5n1W3kBxJ0ImLfHK1xmUNFDIaP7o0IOsXz5zYVO2VWbTrvcCzbLYglJgYHXIpibMBaOvf9An8HFLxCJasSMricc077jc2BwyohIpU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>北京串列加速器核物理国家实验室</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/M2oNibC3l5n0P1JkaqUyuG9XPtdrpEckic5Z39gr68jWibic0yhRNT0KPVT6xHhiaf8yML8k313P19x4FCYCEFpeZOxtic4DsWwMMKprbibcvvwSpE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>核数据全国重点实验室</span></p></section></section><section><p><span>自建所以来，物理所先后完成并取得多项重要科研成果，多次荣获国家和省部级科技进步奖、自然科学奖及其他重要奖项。在被国家表彰的23位“两弹一星”功勋奖章获得者中，于敏、王淦昌、邓稼先、朱光亚、钱三强、彭桓武等科学家都曾在原子能院从事核物理研究工作。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>七十多年来，物理所始终面向国家核科技创新、核工业发展和核科技人才培养需求，现有导师100人，其中博士研究生导师37人、硕士研究生导师63人，为学生开展科研训练和继续深造提供了良好平台。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>二</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>6月30日—7月2日在</span><span><strong><span>中核北京科技园（北京市房山区阜盛西街15号院）</span></strong></span><span><span>开展</span></span><span>。</span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/M2oNibC3l5n15EMGMMPU0rHdXNAu9aOJyjyqQrmzeUXSicvHQ3FL3M1viarlBnW8oQxCYk3eEjPMcgVn5ytRAt7Pibdricsv1xrwLhwvEY78fwsY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><span>本次活动将</span><span><strong><span>免费</span></strong></span><span></span><span>为营员提供夏令营期间在营的食宿，并报销从学校或居住城市往返北京市的普通列车硬席位，以及动车、高铁二等座的费用（需提供车票作为报销证明）。</span></span></p><p><span>报名截止时间：</span><strong><span><span>6月10日</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>三</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>全国高校</span><strong><span><span>全日制2027届本科毕业生</span></span></strong><span>，或成绩特别优秀的全日制2028届本科毕业生，学习成绩优秀、有望取得学校推荐免试研究生资格者优先。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>对核物理及其交叉学科有浓厚兴趣，所学专业包括但不限于物理学、核科学与技术、化学、机械、电子信息、计算机技术等。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>身心健康，诚实守信，学风优良。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>四</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>《原子能院物理所2026年暑期大学生夏令营申请表》</span><strong><span><span>（附件请扫描下方二维码下载，需加盖教务处或院系公章）</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/M2oNibC3l5n1VCeXWK3MyGl0RqIPh46tsjwyz5q4iczKs7fg9JGHNSoCoEDpnDWZTUswWrdTdGMiblNiaVpDcrtWhWeCx194nQJxm9QqhCh3pF4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>成绩单</span><strong><span><span>（需加盖教务处或院系公章）</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>身份证复印件（正反面复印在一张A4纸上）。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>其他证明材料（已发表论文复印件、奖状复印件、英语四六级成绩单复印件、各类证书复印件等）。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>五</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>有意报名的同学请于</span><strong><span><span>6月10日前</span></span></strong><span>将申请材料电子版发送至邮箱：</span><strong><span><span>dnphr@ciae.ac.cn</span></span></strong><span>，邮件主题注明：2026夏令营申请+学校名+姓名。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>我们将根据申请者的材料择优选拔参营人员，并于</span><strong><span><span>6月14日前</span></span></strong><span>以电话方式通知入选的参营人员，未入选者不再另行通知，敬请理解。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>六</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>原子能院及物理所发展现状、主要研究方向和科研平台介绍；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>研究生招生政策和培养情况介绍；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>核物理、核数据、加速器技术、中子科学、激光技术等方向专题学术讲座；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>参观科研设施和实验平台，近距离感受核物理研究一线。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>七</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>参加夏令营活动的同学应遵守夏令营的各项规定，不得擅自离营，按照统一安排全程参加各项营内活动。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>2</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动期间，学生安全由本人负责，物理所将为营员购买意外伤害短期保险，正常医疗费用由学生本人及所在学校负责。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>如有任何疑问，欢迎电话咨询。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：13651327182</span></p><p><span>通讯地址：北京市房山区新镇三强路一号中国原子能科学研究院</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><strong><span>推荐阅读</span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>▼</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（点击图片即可获取全文）</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5NTk1MzUxMw==&amp;mid=2650881835&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6500dacc73f973d62a6e0c9718fe13e2&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/M2oNibC3l5n06EW1icECjrIic94TIicLdja8jfial8RBJgCxw8B3Vu7IS8ahicjkj8ZBLAvOOt70fdnKoRqOO0kwBl7RMDLqTOYXdKSerLiaH7riaxk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>核技术＋农业！我国新型辐照育种加速器研制成功</span></span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>素材提供丨核物理研究所</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span>责编、制作丨陈琬</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>责校丨李文琪</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha